# An example of this home's own settings for rapid-selector. Copy it to config/home.env and
# edit it there: config/home.env is ignored by git (config/README.md). KEY=VALUE lines, read
# literally: no quotes, no comments after a value. No secrets here; they stay in .env.
#
# Budgets in USD, reset every 30 days. scripts/setup-keys.sh applies them. The two team budgets
# must add up to no more than the global budget, litellm_settings.max_budget in
# config/gateway.yaml (the rules check refuses otherwise).
# Team permanent: the roles, used by Node-RED and other automation.
BUDGET_TEAM_PERMANENT=2
# Team experiments: every name, used by chat and the smoke test.
BUDGET_TEAM_EXPERIMENTS=8
# Node-RED's own key, inside team permanent.
BUDGET_KEY_NODE_RED=1
# The smoke test's key, inside team experiments.
BUDGET_KEY_SMOKE_TEST=1
# Node-RED's limits per minute (scripts/setup-keys.sh): requests, and input plus output tokens.
NODE_RED_RPM=30
NODE_RED_TPM=100000
# The allowed providers in your OpenRouter account's settings, as tags separated by spaces (the
# part before "/" in an endpoint such as deepinfra/fp8). They must match the account: the rules
# check (scripts/check-prices.sh) refuses an entry pinned to any other host.
ALLOWED_HOSTS=coreweave deepinfra siliconflow
# The clone's folder on the host, for scripts/copy-config.sh: absolute, or relative to the home
# directory there. Without it, the same place under the home directory as this clone.
# RAPIDSELECTOR_REMOTE_DIR=code/rapid-selector
